        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that the voice of the people came against Amlici, that he was not made king over the people.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 29,
            "end": 34,
            "text": "Mosiah 29:25 (25–27)."
