        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 2:7",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Now this did cause much joy in the hearts of those who were against him; but Amlici did stir up those who were in his favor to anger against those who were not in his favor.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 2:8",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 8
      },
