        "reference": "Alma 2:9",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Now when Amlici was made king over them he commanded them that they should take up arms against their brethren; and this he did that he might subject them to him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 2:10",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 10
      },
