        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "And Alma sent spies to follow the remnant of the Amlicites, that he might know of their plans and their plots, whereby he might guard himself against them, that he might preserve his people from being destroyed.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 2:21",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "Now those whom he had sent out to watch the camp of the Amlicites were called Zeram, and Amnor, and Manti, and Limher; these were they who went out with their men to watch the camp of the Amlicites.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
