        "reference": "Alma 2:34",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 34
      },
      {
        "text": "And it came to pass that when they had all crossed the river Sidon that the Lamanites and the Amlicites began to flee before them, notwithstanding they were so numerous that they could not be numbered.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
