        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 35
      },
      {
        "text": "And they fled before the Nephites towards the wilderness which was west and north, away beyond the borders of the land; and the Nephites did pursue them with their might, and did slay them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 36,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Alma 2:36",
        "book": "Alma",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 36
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, they were met on every hand, and slain and driven, until they were scattered on the west, and on the north, until they had reached the wilderness, which was called Hermounts; and it was that part of the wilderness which was infested by wild and ravenous beasts.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
